Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:04:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] The ask's answer reads no guard nothing can trip, and the
 tests hold every voice kind and every refusal they name

Mutation testing the representation work left two survivors. The answer's handler checked the offer was still offered and
unanswered, but only an ask puts it on the clock and declining calls it off with the offer's other items, so no player
could reach either check; it reads only what it needs now. Reverting one of the four voice kinds' agent access went
unnoticed because the journey found a voice part of another kind; the journey now reads each kind the slate makes. A
voice demo sent with an approach, a life whose recorded work is all voice, and the one-agent refusal naming what the
other agreement covers each got a test, since each had a line no test would miss. The tutorial's factors name voice
work for a voice-over department, which the chapter's list said was stage and screen for every office.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
